  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government of Croatia &#x2013; UNDP partnership in Ukraine Enhancing Mine Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The MAP has been designed in accordance with mine action&#x2019;s needs-driven, people-centred approach. As outlined in the UN Mine Action strategy 2019-2024 (ref cross-cutting issue # 2) UNDP will address the specific needs of women, girls, men and boys from diverse groups, while facilitating their empowerment and inclusion. United Nations Gender Guidelines for Mine Action Programmes (2019) will be an important tool in this regard, also drawing on the UN Resolution 1325 on Women, Peace and Security an</narrative>
  </description>
